{"item":0},{"from_address":"235","from_name":"236","subject":"220","text":"218","date":"221","message_id":"225","resume":"234","categorie":"233"},{"item":0},{"subExecution":"237"},{"item":0},{"item":0},{"date":"238","expediteur":"239","categorie":"233","resume":"234","auto_envoye":false,"boite":null,"id":402,"createdAt":"240","updatedAt":"240"},{"item":0},{"boite":"241","recu_le":"221","from_address":"235","from_name":"236","subject":"220","message_id":"225","extrait":"218","resume":"234","categorie":"233","uid":"242","id":193,"createdAt":"243","updatedAt":"243"},{"item":0},{"item":0},{"categorie":"233","urgent":false,"resume":"234","auto_envoi_possible":false,"reponse_requise":true,"targetFolder":"244","markAsRead":false},{"item":0},{"item":0},{"path":"245","destination":"244","uidValidity":"246","uidMap":"247"},{"item":0},{"return-path":"248","delivered-to":"249","received":"250","authentication-results":"251","dkim-signature":"252","x-google-dkim-signature":"253","x-forwarded-encrypted":"254","x-gm-message-state":"255","x-gm-gg":"256","x-received":"257","from":"258","content-type":"259","x-priority":"260","subject":"261","date":"262","message-id":"263","cc":"264","to":"265","mime-version":"266","x-mailer":"267","x-spam-score":"268","x-spam-detail":"269","x-spam-verdict":"270","x-spam-state":"271","x-infomaniak-type":"272","x-infomaniak-dcc-fuz1":"273","x-infomaniak-dcc-fuz2":"274","x-infomaniak-pyzor-hash":"275","x-infomaniak-spam":"276","x-infomaniak-cause":"277","x-rspamd-queue-id":"278","x-rspamd-server":"279","x-rspamd-action":"280","x-spamd-result":"281"},"<html aria-label=\\"message body\\"><head><meta http-equiv=\\"content-type\\" content=\\"text/html; charset=utf-8\\"></head><body style=\\"overflow-wrap: break-word; -webkit-nbsp-mode: space; line-break: after-white-space;\\"><p style=\\"margin: 0px; font-width: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;\\">Bonjour,</p>\\n<p style=\\"margin: 0px; font-width: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 16px;\\"><br></p>\\n<p style=\\"margin: 0px; font-width: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;\\">Comme convenu, je vous adresse en pièce jointe ma lettre de mission pour l’accompagnement du projet de réaménagement de votre magasin.</p>\\n<p style=\\"margin: 0px; font-width: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 16px;\\"><br></p>\\n<p style=\\"margin: 0px; font-width: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;\\">Vous y retrouverez les grandes orientations évoquées ensemble, les différentes phases de conception ainsi que les conditions de mon intervention.</p>\\n<p style=\\"margin: 0px; font-width: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 16px;\\"><br></p>\\n<p style=\\"margin: 0px; font-width: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;\\"><b>Pour la suite</b>, après validation de cette proposition, nous pourrons organiser un premier échange avec Valentin afin de préciser les priorités, rassembler les éléments nécessaires et préparer le démarrage de la phase de réflexion et d’organisation des espaces, prévu début le 1 décembre.</p>\\n<p style=\\"margin: 0px; font-width: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 16px;\\"><br></p>\\n<p style=\\"margin: 0px; font-width: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: system-ui; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;\\">Je reste bien entendu à votre disposition pour échanger sur ces différents points.</p><div>\\n<div style=\\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;\\"><br class=\\"Apple-interchange-newline\\">Bien cordialement</div><div style=\\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;\\"><br></div><div style=\\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;\\">Jean-Philippe Ekert</div><div style=\\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;\\"><a href=\\"htpps://www.modulign.com\\">https//www.modulign.com</a></div>\\n</div>\\n<br><div></div></body></html><br/>\\n<html aria-label=\\"message body\\"><head><meta http-equiv=\\"content-type\\" content=\\"text/html; charset=us-ascii\\"></head><body style=\\"overflow-wrap: break-word; -webkit-nbsp-mode: space; line-break: after-white-space;\\"><div></div></body></html>","Bonjour,\\n\\nComme convenu, je vous adresse en pièce jointe ma lettre de mission pour l’accompagnement du projet de réaménagement de votre magasin.\\n\\nVous y retrouverez les grandes orientations évoquées ensemble, les différentes phases de conception ainsi que les conditions de mon intervention.\\n\\nPour la suite, après validation de cette proposition, nous pourrons organiser un premier échange avec Valentin afin de préciser les priorités, rassembler les éléments nécessaires et préparer le démarrage de la phase de réflexion et d’organisation des espaces, prévu début le 1 décembre.\\n\\nJe reste bien entendu à votre disposition pour échanger sur ces différents points.\\n\\nBien cordialement\\n\\nJean-Philippe Ekert\\nhttps//www.modulign.com <htpps://www.modulign.com>\\n￼","<p>Bonjour,</p><p>Comme convenu, je vous adresse en pi&egrave;ce jointe ma lettre de mission pour l&rsquo;accompagnement du projet de r&eacute;am&eacute;nagement de votre magasin.</p><p>Vous y retrouverez les grandes orientations &eacute;voqu&eacute;es ensemble, les diff&eacute;rentes phases de conception ainsi que les conditions de mon intervention.</p><p>Pour la suite, apr&egrave;s validation de cette proposition, nous pourrons organiser un premier &eacute;change avec Valentin afin de pr&eacute;ciser les priorit&eacute;s, rassembler les &eacute;l&eacute;ments n&eacute;cessaires et pr&eacute;parer le d&eacute;marrage de la phase de r&eacute;flexion et d&rsquo;organisation des espaces, pr&eacute;vu d&eacute;but le 1 d&eacute;cembre.</p><p>Je reste bien entendu &agrave; votre disposition pour &eacute;changer sur ces diff&eacute;rents points.</p><p>Bien cordialement</p><p>Jean-Philippe Ekert<br/>https//www.modulign.com &lt;htpps://www.modulign.com&gt;<br/>&#xFFFC;</p>","Lettre de mission Développement Concept Magasin Toutengros","2026-10-31T10:12:11.000Z",{"value":"282","html":"283","text":"284"},{"value":"285","html":"286","text":"239"},{"value":"287","html":"286","text":"239"},"<974FDFA6-6B37-4EF6-983B-09DD63A6235E@gmail.com>",{"uid":3440},{"mimeType":"288","fileType":"289","fileExtension":"289","data":"290","fileName":"291","id":"292","fileSize":"293","bytes":4128341},{"generations":"294"},{"completionTokens":125,"promptTokens":1147,"totalTokens":1272},["295"],{"anthropic_api_key":"296","model":"297","anthropic_api_url":"298","max_tokens":16384,"invocation_kwargs":"299","client_options":"300","streaming":false,"api_key":"301"},"```json\\n{\\n  \\"categorie\\": \\"administratif\\",\\n  \\"urgent\\": false,\\n  \\"resume\\": \\"Jean-Philippe Ekert envoie sa lettre de mission pour le réaménagement du magasin Toutengros, avec les phases de conception et conditions d'intervention. Un échange avec Valentin est prévu après validation, pour un démarrage fixé au 1er décembre.\\",\\n  \\"auto_envoi_possible\\": false,\\n  \\"reponse_requise\\": true\\n}\\n```","administratif","Jean-Philippe Ekert envoie sa lettre de mission pour le réaménagement du magasin Toutengros, avec les phases de conception et conditions d'intervention. Un échange avec Valentin est prévu après validation, pour un démarrage fixé au 1er décembre.","ekertjph@gmail.com","Jean-Philippe Ekert",{"workflowId":"302","executionId":"303"},"2026-10-31T10:12:00.000Z","\\"Jean-Philippe Ekert\\" <ekertjph@gmail.com>","2026-10-31T10:12:24.109Z","v.caufriez","3440","2026-10-31T10:12:24.158Z","Tri-Administratif","INBOX","1732048263",{},"Return-Path: <ekertjph@gmail.com>","Delivered-To: v.caufriez@ebanista.fr"