r mon tableau des achats, voici le résumé :&nbsp;</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<ul data-editing-info=\\"{&quot;applyListStyleFromLevel&quot;:false,&quot;unorderedStyleType&quot;:2}\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\\">\\n<li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-position: initial; list-style-type: &quot;- &quot;;\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr;\\">Commande EDF de 79 420 € HT</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-position: initial; list-style-type: &quot;- &quot;;\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr;\\">Offre d'EUROBOX pour 2 conteneurs (+ 2 fenêtres + porte + isolation par l'intérieur) livrés à VALAURIE à 24 570 € HT</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-type: &quot;- &quot;;\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr;\\">Offre clim à 1800 €</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-position: initial; list-style-type: &quot;- &quot;;\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr;\\">Mon tableau de suivi des achats (3ème onglet - V3), qui te montre que mes achats se montent à 27 710.40 €, sans ton offre</div>\\n</li></ul>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<ul data-editing-info=\\"{&quot;applyListStyleFromLevel&quot;:false,&quot;unorderedStyleType&quot;:8}\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\\">\\n<li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-position: initial; list-style-type: &quot;➔ &quot;;\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr;\\">Cela te permet de voir que ton offre globale, dans la mesure du possible bien sûr, ne devrait pas dépasser 41 709,60 € HT</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr;\\"><br>\\n</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); list-style-position: initial; list-style-type: &quot;➔ &quot;;\\">\\n<table id=\\"x_table_0_0\\" data-editing-info=\\"{&quot;topBorderColor&quot;:&quot;#000000&quot;,&quot;bottomBorderColor&quot;:&quot;#000000&quot;,&quot;verticalBorderColor&quot;:&quot;#000000&quot;,&quot;hasHeaderRow&quot;:false,&quot;hasFirstColumn&quot;:false,&quot;hasBandedRows&quot;:false,&quot;hasBandedColumns&quot;:false,&quot;bgColorEven&quot;:null,&quot;bgColorOdd&quot;:&quot;#EEEEEE&quot;,&quot;headerRowColor&quot;:&quot;#ABABAB&quot;,&quot;tableBorderFormat&quot;:0,&quot;verticalAlign&quot;:null}\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; margin-bottom: 1px; box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px;\\">\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td style=\\"direction: ltr; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: black; padding-right: 7.2px; padding-left: 7.2px; width: 302.5px; height: 22px; min-width: 15px; box-si