s;un annuaire professionnel. Pour ne plus recevoir de message, r&eacute;pondez &laquo; stop &raquo;.</p>","menuisier à Valaurie","2026-10-29T07:40:03.000Z",{"value":"199","html":"200","text":"201"},{"value":"202","html":"203","text":"204"},"<01a1869a-0533-75ec-b7fe-32150556e270@appgmaopro.com>",{"uid":3426},{"generations":"205"},{"completionTokens":100,"promptTokens":1123,"totalTokens":1223},["206"],{"anthropic_api_key":"207","model":"208","anthropic_api_url":"209","max_tokens":16384,"invocation_kwargs":"210","client_options":"211","streaming":false,"api_key":"212"},"```json\\n{\\n  \\"categorie\\": \\"spam\\",\\n  \\"urgent\\": false,\\n  \\"resume\\": \\"Démarchage commercial non sollicité proposant des services de référencement Google et création de site web pour artisans, à 9,90 € puis 39 €/mois.\\",\\n  \\"auto_envoi_possible\\": false,\\n  \\"reponse_requise\\": false\\n}\\n```","spam","Démarchage commercial non sollicité proposant des services de référencement Google et création de site web pour artisans, à 9,90 € puis 39 €/mois.","Spam","INBOX","1732048240",{},"Return-Path: <o.sissoko@appgmaopro.com>","Delivered-To: v.caufriez@ebanista.fr","Received: from 01a1869a-0533-75ec-b7fe-32150556e270.local (ec2-13-219-90-67.compute-1.amazonaws.com. [13.219.90.67])\\r\\n        by smtp.gmail.com with ESMTPSA id af79cd13be357-940f0a7c41asm1465471485a.36.2026.10.29.00.40.03\\r\\n        for <v.caufriez@ebanista.fr>\\r\\n        (version=TLS1_3 cipher=TLS_AES_256_GCM_SHA384 bits=256/256);\\r\\n        Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:40:03 -0700 (PDT)","Authentication-Results: mx.infomaniak.com; spf=pass smtp.mailfrom=appgmaopro.com","DKIM-Signature: v=1; a=rsa-sha256; c=relaxed/relaxed;\\r\\n        d=appgmaopro.com; s=google; t=1793259604; x=1793864404; darn=ebanista.fr;\\r\\n        h=content-type:mime-version:date:content-transfer-encoding:subject:to\\r\\n         :from:list-unsubscribe-post:list-unsubscribe:message-id:from:to:cc\\r\\n         :subject:date:message-id:reply-to:co