\"175\\" height=\\"118\\" style=\\"width: 1.825in; height: 1.2333in; max-width: 630px; min-width: auto; min-height: auto; margin: 0px;\\" size=\\"40872\\" data-outlook-trace=\\"F:4|T:4\\" src=\\"data:image/png;base64,\\"></i></b></span></div>\\n</div>\\n<div id=\\"appendonsend\\"></div>\\n<hr style=\\"display:inline-block;width:98%\\" tabindex=\\"-1\\">\\n<div id=\\"divRplyFwdMsg\\" dir=\\"ltr\\"><font face=\\"Calibri, sans-serif\\" style=\\"font-size:11pt\\" color=\\"#000000\\"><b>De :</b> Caufriez Valentin &lt;v.caufriez@ebanista.fr&gt;<br>\\n<b>Envoyé :</b> mardi 3 novembre 2026 17:48<br>\\n<b>À :</b> L. Sauzade - UniTech &lt;lsauzade@unitecheu.com&gt;<br>\\n<b>Objet :</b> RE: NLC-2025-074_010-AMTPON-26 : Demande de prix 2 conteneurs 20' &quot;BUREAU&quot; + &quot;OUTILLAGE&quot;</font>\\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\\n</div>\\n<style>\\n<!--\\n.x_ws-ng-mail-style--66eJwLKcrUDS7NLMt0zslMzSsBACzcBcw, .x_ws-ng-mail-style--66eJwLKcrUDS7NLMt0zslMzSsBACzcBcw *\\n\\t{outline:none;\\n\\tbox-sizing:content-box;\\n\\tline-height:initial}\\n.x_ws-ng-mail-style--66eJwLKcrUDS7NLMt0zslMzSsBACzcBcw b\\n\\t{font-weight:bold}\\n.x_ws-ng-mail-style--66eJwLKcrUDS7NLMt0zslMzSsBACzcBcw table\\n\\t{border-collapse:separate}\\n.x_ws-ng-mail-style--66eJwLKcrUDS7NLMt0zslMzSsBACzcBcw h2\\n\\t{color:unset}\\n.x_ws-ng-mail-style--66eJwLKcrUDS7NLMt0zslMzSsBACzcBcw a\\n\\t{line-height:inherit}\\n.x_ws-ng-mail-style--66eJwLKcrUDS7NLMt0zslMzSsBACzcBcw p\\n\\t{display:block}\\n.x_ws-ng-mail-style--66eJwLKcrUDS7NLMt0zslMzSsBACzcBcw ul\\n\\t{margin-top:revert;\\n\\tmargin-bottom:revert}\\n-->\\n</style>\\n<div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\nSalut Ludivine,</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\nPour les fenêtres, les modèles de 200 cm conviennent très bien. Si les modèles de 100 cm sont moins chers, on peut aussi partir là-dessus, cela ne change rien pour nous.</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\nPar contre, attention : il me semble que l'isolant prévu (polyuréthane) n'est pas ignifugé. Il faut valider ce point avec lui.</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\nDe plus, comme nous devons fixer des éléments sur les parois, demande-lui précisément ce que l'ajout des profils en acier implique (coût, délai, ou autre).</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\nCordialement,</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-squire-root-node=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5\\">\\nValentin&nbsp;</div>\\n</div>\\n<div data-ik-opengraph-ignore=\\"\\" class=\\"x_ik_mail_quote x_answerContentMessage\\">\\n<div>Le 2026-10-30T09:00:37.000+01:00, L. Sauzade - UniTech &lt;lsauzade@unitecheu.com&gt; a écrit :</div>\\n<blockquote class=\\"x_ws-ng-quote\\">\\n<div class=\\"x_ws-ng-mail-style--66eJwLKcrUDS7NLMt0zslMzSsBACzcBcw\\">\\n<div class=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;,Trebuchet,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">\\nSalut Valentin,</div>\\n<div class=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;,Trebuchet,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;,Trebuchet,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"\\" style=\\"font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;,Trebuchet,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">\\nA ton avis, que dois-je répondre à sa question ci-desso