"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              \\">Vous trouverez votre facture en pi&egrave;ce jointe &agrave; cet e-mail.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              color: #5F6C76;\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11pt;              color: #C0504D;\\">INFORMATION SUR LA FACTURATION &Eacute;LECTRONIQUE</span></p><p style=\\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              color: #5F6C76;\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              \\">Depuis le </span><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11pt;              \\">1er septembre 2026</span><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              \\">, toutes les entreprises &eacute;tablies en France doivent &ecirc;tre en mesure de recevoir leurs factures au format &eacute;lectronique via une Plateforme Agr&eacute;&eacute;e par l&rsquo;&Eacute;tat.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              \\">Afin de garantir une transition fluide et s&eacute;curis&eacute;e, </span><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11pt;              \\">LMC mettra progressivement en place l&rsquo;&eacute;mission de ses factures sous ce nouveau format</span><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              \\">, le temps de s&rsquo;assurer que les transmissions vers les diff&eacute;rentes plateformes s&rsquo;op&egrave;rent correctement.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              color: #5F6C76;\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11pt;              color: #C0504D;\\">CE QU'IL FAUT RETENIR</span></p><p style=\\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              color: #5F6C76;\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              \\">1. </span><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11pt;              \\">Le passage sera progressif </span><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              \\">: toutes les factures ne basculeront pas au m&ecirc;me moment.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              \\">2. </span><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11pt;              \\">Vous serez inform&eacute; par e-mail </span><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              \\">d&egrave;s que vos factures seront effectivement transmises via votre Plateforme Agr&eacute;&eacute;e.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              \\">3. </span><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11pt;              \\">D&rsquo;ici l&agrave;, rien ne change </span><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              \\">: vos factures restent disponibles sur votre espace client lmcstore.com et sont transmises par vos canaux habituels.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              color: #5F6C76;\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: bold;font-size: 11pt;              \\">Aucune d&eacute;marche particuli&egrave;re n&rsquo;est &agrave; effectuer aupr&egrave;s de LMC &agrave; ce stade.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              color: #5F6C76;\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              \\">Pour toute question concernant le passage &agrave; la facturation &eacute;lectronique, notre service client d&eacute;di&eacute; reste &agrave; votre disposition : facturation-electronique@lmc-group.com</span></p><p style=\\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              color: #5F6C76;\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              \\">Votre entreprise n&rsquo;a pas encore engag&eacute; les d&eacute;marches ? https://www.economie.gouv.fr/tout-savoir-sur-la-facturation-electronique-pour-les-entreprises</span></p><p style=\\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              color: #5F6C76;\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              \\">Nous vous remercions de votre confiance et restons &agrave; votre disposition pour toute demande compl&eacute;mentaire.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              color: #5F6C76;\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              \\">&Agrave; bient&ocirc;t.</span></p><p style=\\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              color: #5F6C76;\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              \\">Le service comptabilit&eacute;</span></p><p style=\\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              color: #5F6C76;\\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;\\"><span style=\\"font-family:  Calibri ;font-style: Normal;font-weight: normal;font-size: 11pt;              \\">Conditions G&eacute;n&eacute;rales de Vente : https://www.lmcstore.c