les communications par messagerie &eacute;lectronique arrivent en temps utile, sont s&eacute;curis&eacute;es ou d&eacute;nu&eacute;es de toute erreur ou virus.<br/>____________________________________________________</p><p>This message and any attachments (the &apos;Message&apos;) are intended solely for the addressees. The information contained in this Message is confidential. Any use of information contained in this Message not in accord with its purpose, any dissemination or disclosure, either whole or partial, is prohibited except formal approval.</p><p>If you are not the addressee, you may not copy, forward, disclose or use any part of it. If you have received this message in error, please delete it and all copies from your system and notify the sender immediately by return message.</p><p>E-mail communication cannot be guaranteed to be timely secure, error or virus-free.</p>","RE: Conteneurs EDF AMT VDR - Proposition date pour clarifications techniques",["317","318","227"],"2026-10-27T15:52:20.000Z",{"value":"319","html":"320","text":"321"},{"value":"322","html":"323","text":"247"},{"value":"324","html":"325","text":"326"},"<AM8PR05MB806559D0B2CED171FA51FED0DC602@AM8PR05MB8065.eurprd05.prod.outlook.com>","<MR1P264MB39057EB8235A9CFBB81E1D628AB52@MR1P264MB3905.FRAP264.PROD.OUTLOOK.COM>",{"uid":3420},{"mimeType":"327","fileType":"328","fileExtension":"329","data":"330","fileName":"331","id":"332","fileSize":"333","bytes":24230},{"mimeType":"327","fileType":"328","fileExtension":"329","data":"330","fileName":"334","id":"335","fileSize":"336","bytes":36912},{"mimeType":"327","fileType":"328","fileExtension":"329","data":"330","fileName":"337","id":"338","fileSize":"339","bytes":83753},{"mimeType":"327","fileType":"328","fileExtension":"329","data":"330","fileName":"340","id":"341","fileSize":"342","bytes":40872},{"mimeType":"327","fileType":"328","fileExtension":"329","data":"330","fileName":"343","id":"344","fileSize":"339","bytes":83753},{"mimeType":"327","fileTyp