143","client_options":"144","streaming":false,"temperature":0.4,"api_key":"145"},"Bonjour Monsieur Pons,\\n\\nMerci beaucoup pour l'envoi du devis n° 3728724.\\n\\nNous allons l'étudier et reviendrons vers vous prochainement.\\n\\nBien cordialement,\\n\\n[À COMPLÉTER : signature]","From: Ebanista <comptabilite@ebanista.fr>\\r\\nTo: Rodrigue Pons <Rodrigue-Pons@cica-bois.fr>\\r\\nSubject: =?UTF-8?B?UmU6IERFVklTIA==?=\\r\\n =?UTF-8?B?MzcyODcyNCBSw6k=?=\\r\\n =?UTF-8?B?Zi4gQ0hFTkUgNA==?=\\r\\n =?UTF-8?B?NSBNTSBFQkFOSQ==?=\\r\\n =?UTF-8?B?U1RB?=\\r\\nDate: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 08:35:52 +0000\\r\\nMessage-ID: <draft-1793003752451-ibcip9kp@ebanista.fr>\\r\\nIn-Reply-To: <GV2P189MB2503AE72F5706702F625C7FAC8612@GV2P189MB2503.EURP189.PROD.OUTLOOK.COM>\\r\\nReferences: <GV2P189MB2503AE72F5706702F625C7FAC8612@GV2P189MB2503.EURP189.PROD.OUTLOOK.COM>\\r\\nMIME-Version: 1.0\\r\\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\\r\\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: base64\\r\\n\\r\\nQm9uam91ciBNb25zaWV1ciBQb25zLA0KDQpNZXJjaSBiZWF1Y291cCBwb3VyIGwnZW52b2kgZHUg\\r\\nZGV2aXMgbsKwIDM3Mjg3MjQuDQoNCk5vdXMgYWxsb25zIGwnw6l0dWRpZXIgZXQgcmV2aWVuZHJv\\r\\nbnMgdmVycyB2b3VzIHByb2NoYWluZW1lbnQuDQoNCkJpZW4gY29yZGlhbGVtZW50LA0KDQpbw4Ag\\r\\nQ09NUEzDiVRFUiA6IHNpZ25hdHVyZV0NCg0KDQpMZSAyNiBvY3RvYnJlIDIwMjYgw6AgMDk6MzUs\\r\\nIFJvZHJpZ3VlIFBvbnMgPFJvZHJpZ3VlLVBvbnNAY2ljYS1ib2lzLmZyPiBhIMOpY3JpdCA6DQo+\\r\\nIEJvbmpvdXIsDQo+IA0KPiBWZXVpbGxleiB0cm91dmVyIGVuIHBpw6hjZSBqb2ludGUgbm90cmUg\\r\\nZGV2aXMgbsKwIDM3Mjg3MjQgYXUgZm9ybWF0IFBERi4NCj4gDQo+IE5vdXMgcmVzdG9ucyDDoCB2\\r\\nb3RyZSBkaXNwb3NpdGlvbiBwb3VyIHRvdXRlcyBhdXRyZXMgcXVlc3Rpb25zLg0KPiANCj4gQ29y\\r\\nZGlhbGVtZW50DQo+IA0KPiANCj4gDQo+IFtjaWQ6aW1hZ2UwMDEucG5nQDAxREQ2NTJELjVDNzM1\\r\\nOTYwXTxodHRwczovL3d3dy5jaWNhLWFnZW5jZW1lbnQuZnIvPg0KPiBbY2lkOmltYWdlMDAyLnBu\\r\\nZ0AwMURENjUyRC41QzczNTk2MF08aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuY2ljYS1hZ2VuY2VtZW50LmZyLz4NCj4g\\r\\nW2NpZDppbWFnZTAwMy5wbmdAMDFERDY1MkQuNUM3MzU5NjBdPGh0dHBzOi8vd3d3LmZhY2Vib29r\\r\\nLmNvbS9DaWNhTW91cnM+DQo+IFtjaWQ6aW1hZ2UwMDQucG5nQDAx