com/l/ADFANwAAABAAAAAABhfFFA.4dbTI9sHyKA>\\n[facebook]<https://app.signitic.com/l/ADFANwAAAA4AAAAABhfFFA.2VohOkAmHaQ>\\n[instagram]<https://app.signitic.com/l/ADFANwAAABIAAAAABhfFFA.9cfEr5etJa0>\\n[youtube]<https://app.signitic.com/l/ADFANwAAABMAAAAABhfFFA.zIq9kwCoR0Q>\\n\\n[FR - INTL - GTI Neoconnect 2026]\\n[This e-mail message and any attachment hereto are intended only for the above-mentioned recipient(s). Their contents are confidential. If you received this e-mail in error, please notify us immediately, and delete it as well as any attachment, without making any copy, nor disclosing the contents, nor taking any action based thereon. Thank you.  Please consider the environment before printing this e-mail.]\\n\\nDe : Caufriez Valentin <v.caufriez@ebanista.fr>\\nEnvoyé : mercredi 28 octobre 2026 07:55\\nÀ : VEKEMANS Jeanne <jeanne.vekemans@gerflor.com>\\nCc : OTTON Thomas <thomas.otton@gerflor.com>; FUSTIER Damien <damien.fustier@gerflor.com>\\nObjet : Re: TR: Bois fissuré en salle Bellecour (Vaise)\\n\\nATTENTION ! Ce message a été envoyé de l'extérieur. Veuillez ne pas cliquer sur les liens ni ouvrir les pièces jointes, à moins que vous ne connaissiez l'émetteur et que le contenu soit sûr.\\nCAUTION ! This email was sent from outside the company. Please do not click links or open attachments unless you recognize the source of this email and know the content is safe.\\n________________________________\\nSalut Jeanne,\\n\\nCi-joint tu trouveras les deux offres.\\n\\nBonne journée\\n\\nValentin\\nLe 2026-10-27T14:04:36.000+01:00, VEKEMANS Jeanne <jeanne.vekemans@gerflor.com<mailto:jeanne.vekemans@gerflor.com>> a écrit :\\nHello Valentin,\\n\\nTu vas bien ?\\n\\nPourrais-tu stp faire un devis et prévoir de réparer la partie base du plan incliné sur le meuble du milieu dans la salle Bellecour à Vaise ?\\n\\nJe t'appelle\\n\\nMerci bien\\n\\nBonne journée\\n\\n\\nJeanne VEKEMANS\\nChargée de communication\\n\\n+33 7 72 72 58 50\\n+33 7 72 72 58 50\\n\\njeanne.vekemans@gerflor.com<mailto:jeanne.vekemans@gerflor.com>\\n<https://protect.checkpoint.com/v2/r02/___https:/app.signitic.com/l/ADEwswAAABA.HCiPYtxlBrE___.YzJlOmdlcmZsb3JzcGE6YzpvOjA1OTQ0MDNlZTA1NWFhNjBlZGIyZWVmMmM4ZjQxMjg1Ojc6MGYyOToyYWM1MzNjYWU5YTk5ODl","3436","2026-10-30T07:55:49.611Z","Tri-SuiviClient","INBOX","1732048262",{},"Return-Path: <thomas.otton@gerflor.com>","Delivered-To: v.caufriez@ebanista.fr","Received: from AM8PR08MB6371.eurprd08.prod.outlook.com\\r\\n ([fe80::3862:dcc5:a77a:bbef]) by AM8PR08MB6371.eurprd08.prod.outlook.com\\r\\n ([fe80::3862:dcc5:a77a:bbef%5]) with mapi id 15.21.0569.008; Fri, 30 Oct 2026\\r\\n 07:55:13 +0000","Authentication-Results: mx.infomaniak.com; spf=pass smtp.mailfrom=gerflor.com","ARC-Seal: i=1; a=rsa-sha256; s=arcselector10001; d=microsoft.com; cv=none;\\r\\n ","ARC-Message-Signature: i=1; a=rsa-sha256; c=relaxed/relaxed; d=microsoft.com;\\r\\n s=arcselector10001;\\r\\n h=From:Date:Subject:Message-ID:Content-Type:MIME-Version:X-MS-Exchange-AntiSpam-MessageData-ChunkCount:X-MS-Exchange-AntiSpam-MessageData-0:X-MS-Exchange-AntiSpam-MessageData-1;\\r\\n bh=Z/H0T2rReBQ0nG3jrn5ce7wRW+sa6Fkch7AopGITI5w=;\\r\\n ","ARC-Authentication-Results: i=1; mx.microsoft.com 1; spf=pass\\r\\n smtp.mailfrom=gerflor.com; dmarc=pass action=none header.from=gerflor.com;\\r\\n dkim=pass header.d=gerflor.com; arc=none","DKIM-Signature: v=1; a=rsa-sha256; c=relaxed/relaxed; d=gerflor.com;\\r\\n s=selector1;\\r\\n h=From:Date:Subject:Message-ID:Content-Type:MIME-Version:X-MS-Exchange-SenderADCheck;\\r\\n bh=Z/H0T2rReBQ0nG3jrn5ce7wRW+sa6Fkch7AopGITI5w=;\\r\\n ","X-MS-Exchange-Authentication-Results: mx.microsoft.com 1; spf=pass (sender IP\\r\\n is 52.17.62.50) smtp.mailfrom=gerflor.com; dkim=pass (signature was verified)\\r\\n header.d=gerflor.com;dmarc=pass action=none header.from=gerflor.com;","Received-SPF: Pass (protection.outlook.com: domain of gerflor.com designates\\r\\n 52.17.62.50 as permitted sender) receiver=protection.outlook.com;\\r\\n client-