rnant les fenêtres, je suis parti sur le modèle standard et en stock chez nous en largeur 200cm (voir photo n°2) qui sont déjà équipées de volets roulants. Sinon j’ai des fenêtres de 100cm de large (photo). Est-ce qu’il faut\\n impérativement du 120cm ?&nbsp;</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr;\\"><br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr;\\"><br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: black;\\">\\nCordialement,&nbsp;</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; color: black;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px;\\"><br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr;\\"><img size=\\"209963\\" data-outlook-trace=\\"F:2|T:2\\" src=\\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\\"></div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr;\\"><img size=\\"46925\\" data-outlook-trace=\\"F:2|T:2\\" src=\\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\\"></div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr;\\"><img size=\\"66683\\" data-outlook-trace=\\"F:2|T:2\\" src=\\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\\"></div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr;\\"><br>\\n</div>\\n<table cellspacing=\\"0\\" cellpadding=\\"0\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; background-color: white; margin: 0px; width: 600px; color: white; box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px;\\">\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; vertical-align: top; box-sizing: border-box;\\">\\n<table cellspacing=\\"0\\" cellpadding=\\"0\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 600px; box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px;\\">\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; vertical-align: top; box-sizing: border-box;\\">\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Arial; font-size: 12px; color: white;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<table cellspacing=\\"0\\" cellpadding=\\"0\\" border=\\"0\\" style=\\"direction: 