\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Times; font-size: 14px; color: black;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr;\\"><br>\\n<br>\\n<br>\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr;\\"><br>\\n</div>\\n<blockquote>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr;\\">Le 29 oct. 2026 à 15:35, L. Sauzade - UniTech &lt;lsauzade@unitecheu.com&gt; a écrit :</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr;\\"><br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\nBonjour Stéphane,</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\nPour notre affaire de 2 conteneurs &quot;BUREAU&quot; + &quot;OUTILLAGE&quot;, suite échanges avec l'aménageur, j'ai quelques questions :</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\n<span class=\\"spanWithBackgroundColor\\" style=\\"background-color: yellow;\\"><b><u><br>\\n</u></b></span></div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<ul data-editing-info=\\"{&quot;applyListStyleFromLevel&quot;:false,&quot;unorderedStyleType&quot;:8}\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\\">\\n<li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-position: initial; list-style-type: &quot;➔ &quot;;\\">\\n<div role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr;\\"><b><u>Isolation</u></b>&nbsp;:  <span style=\\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\\">Quelle est la nature exacte/matière du revêtement intérieur ?</span></div>\\n</li></ul>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 14px;\\">\\n             &nbsp; &nbsp;Quelle est l'épaisseur des panneaux sandwich ?</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 14px;\\">\\n             &nbsp; &nbsp;Quelles sont tes préconisations de fixation ? (Pour les étagères que nous allons fixer, savoir pour les charges lourdes)</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<ul data-editing-info=\\"{&quot;applyListStyleFromLevel&quot;:false,&quot;unorderedStyleType&quot;:8}\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\\">\\n<li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-position: initial; list-style-type: &quot;➔ &quot;;\\">\\n<div role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\\">\\n<b><u>Fenêtres </u></b>:</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-position: initial; list-style-type: &quot;➔ &quot;;\\">\\n<div role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\\">\\nEspace à laisser pour les fenêtres : 900 mm minimum par rapport au sol et 600 mm minimum par rapport au plafond</div>\\n<div role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\\">\\nSachant cela, peux-tu nous dire les dimensions des 2 fenêtres ?</div>\\n<div role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\\">\\n(Pour rappel : EDF a demandé longueur unitaire de 120 cm. Pour la largeur et la hauteur, c'est toi qui vois, tant que l'on est dans des dimensions standards) ? Cela nous permettra de commander les stores.</div>\\n</li></ul>\\n<div id=\\"x_x_x_Signature\\">\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; background-color: white; margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(200, 38, 19);\\">\\n<b><i>LVNF Nuclear &amp; Logistic Consulting devient UniTech Services à compter du 1er septembre 2026. Nos interlocuteurs et prestations restent inchangés ; seule notre entité et notre adresse e-mail évoluent.</i></b></div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; background-color: white; margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; background-color: white; margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; background-color: white; margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\n<span class=\\"spanWithBackgroundColor\\" style=\\"background-color: white;\\">Cordialement,</span></div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\\">\\n<b>Ludivine SAUZADE</b></div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\\">\\nAdjointe de Direction / CST Classes 2 à 9 / Responsable BU Services</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\n<b><br>\\n</b></div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\\">\\n<b>UNITECH Services France SAS</b></div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\\">\\n<b>Mob:</b>&nbsp;    +&nbsp; 33 7 69 13 71 47</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\\">\\n<b>Tél : </b>     +&nbsp; 33 4 75 00 63 04</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; background-color: white; margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\\">\\n<span class=\\"spanWithBackgroundColor\\" style=\\"background-color: white;\\"><b>Adresse :</b>&nbsp; &nbsp;21B rue Antoine Becquerel - 26230 VALAURIE</span></d