ble>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Times; font-size: 14px;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 14px;\\">\\n<br>\\n<br>\\n<br>\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 14px;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<blockquote>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 14px;\\">\\nLe 21 oct. 2026 à 10:40, L. Sauzade - UniTech &lt;lsauzade@unitecheu.com&gt; a écrit :</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 14px;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\nSalut Stéphane,</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\nConcernant ton offre ci-jointe (D-20260003167 du 01/10) pour la fourniture d'un conteneur 20'DRY &quot;BUREAU&quot; et d'un conteneur 20'DRY &quot;OUTILLAGE&quot;,\\n<b>peux-tu monter ton devis en révision en :</b></div>\\n<ul data-editing-info=\\"{&quot;applyListStyleFromLevel&quot;:false,&quot;unorderedStyleType&quot;:2}\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\\">\\n<li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-position: initial; list-style-type: &quot;- &quot;;\\">\\n<div role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px;\\"><b>Ajoutant l'isolation des 2 conteneurs</b></div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-position: initial; list-style-type: &quot;- &quot;;\\">\\n<div role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px;\\"><b>M'indiquant la répercussion sur ton délai de 5 semaines annoncé ci-dessous</b></div>\\n</li></ul>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\nJe te remercie par avance de ton retour</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div id=\\"x_x_x_x_x_x_Signature\\">\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; background-color: white; margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(200, 38, 19);\\">\\n<b><i>LVNF Nuclear &amp; Logistic Consulting devient UniTech Services à compter du 1er septembre 2026. Nos interlocuteurs et prestations restent inchangés ; seule notre entité et notre adresse e-mail évoluent.</i></b></div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; background-color: white; margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; background-color: white; margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; background-c