230","thread-index":"231","date":"232","message-id":"233","references":"234","in-reply-to":"235","x-ms-has-attach":"236","x-auto-response-suppress":"237","x-ms-exchange-inbox-rules-loop":"238","x-ms-tnef-correlator":"239","x-ms-exchange-parent-message-id":"240","auto-submitted":"241","x-ms-exchange-generated-message-source":"242","x-ms-publictraffictype":"243","x-ms-traffictypediagnostic":"244","x-ms-office365-filtering-correlation-id":"245","x-ms-exchange-senderadcheck":"246","x-ms-exchange-antispam-relay":"247","x-microsoft-antispam":"248","x-microsoft-antispam-message-info":"249","x-forefront-antispam-report":"250","x-ms-exchange-antispam-messagedata-chunkcount":"251","x-ms-exchange-antispam-messagedata-0":"252","content-type":"253","mime-version":"254","x-originatororg":"255","x-ms-exchange-crosstenant-authas":"256","x-ms-exchange-crosstenant-authsource":"257","x-ms-exchange-crosstenant-network-message-id":"258","x-ms-exchange-crosstenant-originalarrivaltime":"259","x-ms-exchange-crosstenant-fromentityheader":"260","x-ms-exchange-crosstenant-id":"261","x-ms-exchange-transport-crosstenantheadersstamped":"262","x-spam-score":"263","x-spam-detail":"264","x-spam-verdict":"265","x-spam-state":"266","x-infomaniak-type":"267","x-infomaniak-dcc-fuz1":"268","x-infomaniak-dcc-fuz2":"269","x-infomaniak-pyzor-hash":"270","x-infomaniak-spam":"271","x-infomaniak-cause":"272","x-rspamd-queue-id":"273","x-rspamd-server":"274","x-rspamd-action":"275","x-spamd-result":"276"},"<html>\\n<head>\\n<meta http-equiv=\\"Content-Type\\" content=\\"text/html; charset=utf-8\\">\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n<div style=\\"font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;,Trebuchet,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">\\n﻿Bonjour,</div>\\n<div style=\\"margin:0cm; font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;,Trebuchet,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">\\n&nbsp;</div>\\n<div style=\\"margin:0cm; font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;,Trebuchet,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">\\n&nbsp;</div>\\n<div style=\\"margin:0cm; font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;,Trebuchet,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">\\nEn déplacement le jeudi 5 novembre, avec un accès très limité à ma boite mail et à mon téléphone.</div>\\n<div style=\\"margin:0cm; font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;,Trebuchet,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">\\nSi urgence, privilégier le sms. Sinon, je serai de retour le vendredi 6 novembre, dès 08h00.</div>\\n<div style=\\"margin:0cm; font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;,Trebuchet,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"margin:0cm; font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;,Trebuchet,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"margin:0cm; font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;,Trebuchet,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">\\nJe&nbsp;vous remercie de votre compréhension,</div>\\n<div style=\\"margin:0cm; font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;,Trebuchet,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"margin:0cm; font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;,Trebuchet,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"margin:0cm; font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;,Trebuchet,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">\\nCordialement,</div>\\n<div style=\\"margin:0cm; font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;,Trebuchet,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">\\n&nbsp;</div>\\n<div style=\\"margin:0cm; font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;,Trebuchet,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">\\n<b>Ludivine SAUZADE</b></div>\\n<div style=\\"margin:0cm; font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;,Trebuchet,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">\\nProject Manager / Responsable BU Services / CST Classes 2 à 9</div>\\n<div style=\\"margin:0cm; font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;,Trebuchet,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">\\n21B rue Antoine BECQUEREL - 26230 VALAURIE</div>\\n<div style=\\"margin:0cm; font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;,Trebuchet,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">\\n07 69 13 71 47 / 04 75 00 63 04 – lsauzade@unitecheu.com</div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family:&quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;,Trebuchet,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; color:rgb(0,0,0)\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\\n","﻿Bonjour,\\n\\n\\nEn déplacement le jeudi 5 novembre, avec un accès très limité à ma boite mail et à mon téléphone.\\nSi urgence, privilégier le sms. Sinon, je serai de retour le vendredi 6 novembre, dès 08h00.\\n\\n\\nJe vous remercie de votre compréhension,\\n\\n\\nCordialement,\\n\\nLudivine SAUZADE\\nProject Manager / Responsable BU Services / CST Classes 2 à 9\\n21B rue Antoine BECQUEREL - 26230 VALAURIE\\n07 69 13 71 47 / 04 75 00 63 04 – lsauzade@unitecheu.com\\n\\n","<p>&#xFEFF;Bonjour,</p><p>En d&eacute;placement le jeudi 5 novembre, avec un acc&egrave;s tr&egrave;s limit&eacute; &agrave; ma boite mail et &agrave; mon t&eacute;l&eacute;phone.<br/>Si urgence, privil&eacute;gier le sms. Sinon, je serai de retour le vendredi 6 novembre, d&egrave;s 08h00.</p><p>Je vous remercie de votre compr&eacute;hension,</p><p>Cordialement,</p><p>Ludivine SAUZADE<br/>Project Manager / Responsable BU Services / CST Classes 2 &agrave; 9<br/>21B rue Antoine BECQUEREL - 26230 VALAURIE<br/>07 69 13 71 47 / 04 75 00 63 04 &ndash; <a href=\\"mailto:lsauzade@unitecheu.com\\">lsauzade@unitecheu.com</a></p>","Réponse automatique : 11-04_Réunion_de_cadrage_Aménagement_des_conteneurs_bureau_et_atelier_pour_EDF-Résumé","<339f00fa-46ea-4554-bb95-6e00578ae502@mail.infomaniak.com>","2026-11-04T13:05:58.000Z",{"value":"277","html":"278","text":"279"},{"value":"280","html":"281","text":"208"},"<ee8f1ae3416045eb8ae9b75ae785afc6@AM8PR05MB8065.eurprd05.prod.outlook.com>",{"uid":3455},{"generations":"282"},{"completionTokens":104,"promptTokens":1152,"totalTokens":1256},["283"],{"anthropic_api_key":"284","model":"285","anthropic_api_url":"286","m