0deaa&amp;elqaid=17160&amp;elqat=1&amp;elqak=8AF5D17FE6FB30B8E70E3F36C9D2D746F69D0C4D47B5232181E96FA2547A88CE7396</a>&gt; &laquo; Decarb Flash Artisanat &raquo; : une aide vers l&rsquo;&eacute;lectrification des &eacute;quipements pour les petites et moyennes entreprises artisanales &lt;<a href=\\"https://app.infos.fiducial.fr/e/er?utm_campaign=102026_Newsletter_FIDUCIAL_2%20%20&utm_medium=email&utm_source=Eloqua&s=602638917&lid=13429&elqTrackId=34A5859E29DC7E3BACA6C7BDEC888849&elq=1ce943638ee34d899deaff026080deaa&elqaid=17160&elqat=1&elqak=8AF5D17FE6FB30B8E70E3F36C9D2D746F69D0C4D47B5232181E96FA2547A88CE7396\\">https://app.infos.fiducial.fr/e/er?utm_campaign=102026_Newsletter_FIDUCIAL_2%20%20&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=Eloqua&amp;s=602638917&amp;lid=13429&amp;elqTrackId=34A5859E29DC7E3BACA6C7BDEC888849&amp;elq=1ce943638ee34d899deaff026080deaa&amp;elqaid=17160&amp;elqat=1&amp;elqak=8AF5D17FE6FB30B8E70E3F36C9D2D746F69D0C4D47B5232181E96FA2547A88CE7396</a>&gt;. En savoir plus &lt;<a href=\\"https://app.infos.fiducial.fr/e/er?utm_campaign=102026_Newsletter_FIDUCIAL_2%20%20&utm_medium=email&utm_source=Eloqua&s=602638917&lid=13503&elqTrackId=8F131EDC38A8FCF47B4D25933C904CE2&elq=1ce943638ee34d899deaff026080deaa&elqaid=17160&elqat=1&elqak=8AF5657D13306A5920538178F1289CB1AC0D0C4D47B5232181E96FA2547A88CE7396\\">https://app.infos.fiducial.fr/e/er?utm_campaign=102026_Newsletter_FIDUCIAL_2%20%20&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=Eloqua&amp;s=602638917&amp;lid=13503&amp;elqTrackId=8F131EDC38A8FCF47B4D25933C904CE2&amp;elq=1ce943638ee34d899deaff026080deaa&amp;elqaid=17160&amp;elqat=1&amp;elqak=8AF5657D13306A5920538178F1289CB1AC0D0C4D47B5232181E96FA2547A88CE7396</a>&gt;</p><p>Focus sur la facturation &eacute;lectronique<br/>---------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&lt;<a href=\\"https://app.infos.fiducial.fr/e/er?utm_campaign=102026_Newsletter_FIDUCIAL_2%20%20&utm_medium=email&utm_source=Eloqua&s=602638917&lid=13511&elqTrackId=D970799769239168C1ABE1AA7471E188&elq=1ce943638ee34d899deaff026080deaa&elqaid=17160&elqat=1&elqak=8AF5F9CDA696614DE9A3D47A1070B487B6070C4D47B5232181E96FA2547A88CE7396\\">https://app.infos.fiducial.fr/e/er?utm_campaign=102026_Newsletter_FIDUCIAL_2%20%20&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=Eloqua&amp;s=602638917&amp;lid=13511&amp;elqTrackId=D970799769239168C1ABE1AA7471E188&amp;elq=1ce943638ee34d899deaff026080deaa&amp;elqaid=17160&amp;elqat=1&amp;elqak=8AF5F9CDA696614DE9A3D47A1070B487B6070C4D47B5232181E96FA2547A88CE7396</a>&gt;</p><p>Entreprise sans client assujetti &agrave; la TVA : quid de l&rsquo;&eacute;mission de factures &eacute;lectroniques ?</p><p>De nombreuses entreprises ne livrent ou ne servent que des particuliers (autrement appel&eacute;s &laquo; consommateurs &raquo;). Soit elles g&egrave;rent leurs ventes via une caisse, soit elles &eacute;tablissent des factures. Dans ce cas, sont-elles tenues d&rsquo;&eacute;mettre des factures &eacute;lectroniques ? Si la r&eacute;ponse est n&eacute;gative, doivent-elles obligatoirement se doter d&rsquo;un logiciel de facturation ? &#x27A1;&#xFE0F; Lire la suite &lt;<a href=\\"https://app.infos.fiducial.fr/e/er?utm_campaign=102026_Newsletter_FIDUCIAL_2%20%20&utm_medium=email&utm_source=Eloqua&s=602638917&lid=13511&elqTrackId=4DA20DE435C506A68CC7B3492475AE58&elq=1ce943638ee34d899deaff026080deaa&elqaid=17160&elqat=1&elqak=8AF5CF59963A26AFEB29CE5A1BAA1EAB679A0C4D47B5232181E96FA2547A88CE7396\\">https://app.infos.fiducial.fr/e/er?utm_campaign=102026_Newsletter_FIDUCIAL_2%20%20&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=Eloqua&amp;s=602638917&amp;lid=13511&amp;elqTrackId=4DA20DE435C506A68CC7B3492475AE58&amp;elq=1ce943638ee34d899deaff026080deaa&amp;elqaid=17160&amp;elqat=1&amp;elqak=8AF5CF59963A26AFEB29CE5A1BAA1EAB679A0C4D47B5232181E96FA2547A88CE7396</a>&gt;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&lt;<a href=\\"https://app.infos.fiducial.fr/e/er?utm_campaign=102026_Newsletter_FIDUCIAL_2%20%20&utm_medium=email&utm_source=Eloqua&s=602638917&lid=4