se":"227","x-spamd-result":"228","x-rspamd-queue-id":"229","x-rspamd-server":"230","x-rspamd-action":"231"},"<html>\\n<head>\\n<meta http-equiv=\\"Content-Type\\" content=\\"text/html; charset=utf-8\\">\\n<style type=\\"text/css\\" style=\\"display:none;\\"> P {margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;} </style>\\n</head>\\n<body dir=\\"ltr\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: Calibri; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-left: 5pt; font-size: 10pt;\\">\\nNon classifié</div>\\n<br>\\n</div>\\nChers clients</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\nNotre action de Noël est de retour <u>dans nos magasins</u> <span style=\\"color: rgb(12, 136, 42);\\">\\n<b>à partir du 2 novembre jusqu'au 24 décembre 2026.</b></span></div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<b><u>A partir de 200€ht</u></b> dans l'un de nos magasins en <u>Drôme ou en Ardèche</u>,\\n<b>repartez un lot</b> 🙂</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; margin: 0px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<b><u>Détail des lots :&nbsp;</u></b></div>\\n<ul data-editing-info=\\"{&quot;orderedStyleType&quot;:1,&quot;unorderedStyleType&quot;:1}\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; list-style-type: disc;\\">\\n<li style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; margin: 0px;\\">\\n<span style=\\"color: rgb(200, 38, 19);\\"><b>LOT 1</b></span> : Pour <b>200 €ht</b> d'achat = 1 Bouteille Rouge Secret de Famille Syrah Jaboulet&nbsp;</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; margin: 0px;\\">\\n<span style=\\"color: rgb(12, 136, 42);\\"><b>LOT 2</b></span> : Pour <b>500 €ht</b> d'achat = 1 Magnum Crozes Hermitage &quot;Les Jalets&quot; Rouge Jaboulet&nbsp;</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; margin: 0px;\\">\\n<span style=\\"color: rgb(12, 100, 192);\\"><b>LOT 3</b></span> : Pour <b>800 €ht</b> d'achat = 1 Crozes Hermitage &quot;Les Jalets&quot; Rouge\\n<b>+</b> 1 Crozes Hermitage &quot;Les Jalets&quot; Blanc <b>+</b> 1 St Joseph &quot;Grand Pompée&quot; Rouge avec emballage carton Jaboulet&nbsp;</div>\\n</li></ul>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(